          <p class="about-tagline">Advanced surgical training. Family dentist's heart. Your smile is in the hands that trained the hands.</p>

          <p>Dr. Matthew Phillips is a general and cosmetic dentist with more than two decades of clinical experience spanning military service, advanced surgical training, and full-arch implant care. He founded 3rd Set Smiles in Tempe, Arizona to deliver comprehensive dentistry &mdash; from cleanings, fillings, and crowns to simple or complex extractions, implants, and dentures, fixed and removable &mdash; in a private, patient-first setting.</p>

          <p>Before opening the practice, Dr. Phillips served as Surgical Training Advisor at Renew Anchored Dentures, founded by ClearChoice co-founder Dr. Don Miloni. In that role he helped establish surgical protocols and trained clinicians in full-arch implant procedures. <!-- CONFIRM: dates and exact role at Renew Anchored Dentures (years served, title at time of departure). --></p>
        </div>

