        <div class="fade-in">
          <h2>Approach to Care</h2>
          <p>Dr. Phillips believes most dental decisions are bigger than a single tooth &mdash; they're about how you eat, smile, sleep, and feel about yourself. Every consultation begins with a real conversation: what brought you in, what you've tried before, and what you actually want the outcome to look like. Recommendations are made in plain language, with honest options, and never under pressure.</p>
